<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Jasmund high-cliff trail: Sassnitz–Lohme — Sassnitz Wedding–Hochuferweg–Lohme</name><desc>Walk from Sassnitz Wedding through the signed coastal beech forest, past the UNESCO World Heritage Forum, Kollicker Ort, Victoria viewpoint and Königsstuhl, then continue along the high coast into Lohme via Arkonastraße. Stay on the marked high paths: cliffs and the beaches below can collapse without warning. Recheck park notices and obey all temporary closures, wildlife-protection barriers and signed diversions; never follow a closed section.

